    {
      "client": "all",
      "path": "AGENTS.md",
      "contents": "# iOS App Factory Rules\n\n## Authority\n\nThis AGENTS.md is the canonical instruction authority for every coding client.\nGenerated client files may point here but cannot weaken it.\n\n## Principles\n\n- Preserve user changes.\n- Bind completion to immutable evidence.\n\n## Enforced rules\n\n- `rule.scope.preserve`: Only change declared paths. (enforced by `broker`; check `policy.changed-paths`)\n- `rule.quality.coherence`: One design generation must cover every public route. (enforced by `trusted-check`; check `quality.ui-coherence`)\n\n## Protected surfaces\n\n- `quality/baselines` — baseline; changes require `quality.baseline-change`.\n\n## Completion\n\nAgent prose is never proof of completion. The broker, trusted checks, independent review, and approval records are authoritative.\n",
      "digest": "sha256:c14f9171244c9b88d412962aa87f1b6355eea2ff9c170ff2c35d36f294b30590"
    },
    {
